; ==============================================================================
;  config\module-map.rc  -  classic LiteStep modules and the nModules that replace them.
;  When a theme loads a module of a classic theme (label-1.99.dll, popup2.dll...),
;  litestep loads the nModule named here instead. The name on the left is the
;  module's normalised name: file name only, lower case, no .dll, no "-<version>".
;  The target is a folder of modules\ (the DLL name without .dll).
;  The first line for a name wins, so a line in personal.rc (included before this
;  file) overrides it; "*ModuleAlias popup2 popup2" keeps the original.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it.
; ==============================================================================
*ModuleAlias label     Label
*ModuleAlias lsslider  Label
*ModuleAlias popup     Popup
*ModuleAlias popup2    Popup
*ModuleAlias lslnkmenu Popup
*ModuleAlias taskbar   TaskBar
*ModuleAlias taskbar3  TaskBar
*ModuleAlias vtray     SysTray
*ModuleAlias ckvwm     VWM
*ModuleAlias shortcut  Icon
*ModuleAlias shortcut2 Icon
*ModuleAlias jdesk     Icon
